<title>USA: Monroe County, N.Y., repriced, yield raised.</title>
<headline>Monroe County, N.Y., repriced, yield raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corp said Thursday it repriced Monroe County, N.Y.'s $15.4 million general obligation bonds, raising the yield in 2000 five basis points.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>COUNTY OF MONROE, NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $15,430,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>					     3,250,000*</p>
<p>			  PUBLIC IMPROVEMENT REFUNDING BONDS 1996D</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa		  S&amp;P: AA-</p>
<p>    DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01</p>
